What are known issues in the unguided transmission media? Why generally rad=
io waves are used in cellular communication not microwave? (5M)</p>
<p data-start=3D"2368" data-end=3D"2381"><strong data-start=3D"2368" data-e=
nd=3D"2379">Answer:</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2382" data-end=3D"3034">
<li data-start=3D"2382" data-end=3D"2689">
<p data-start=3D"2384" data-end=3D"2415"><strong data-start=3D"2384" data-e=
nd=3D"2413">Issues in Unguided Media:</strong></p>
<ol data-start=3D"2418" data-end=3D"2689">
<li data-start=3D"2418" data-end=3D"2470">
<p data-start=3D"2421" data-end=3D"2470"><strong data-start=3D"2421" data-e=
nd=3D"2437">Interference</strong> (from other signals, devices).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2473" data-end=3D"2525">
<p data-start=3D"2476" data-end=3D"2525"><strong data-start=3D"2476" data-e=
nd=3D"2491">Attenuation</strong> (signal weakens over distance).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2528" data-end=3D"2571">
<p data-start=3D"2531" data-end=3D"2571"><strong data-start=3D"2531" data-e=
