</li>
<li data-start=3D"2574" data-end=3D"2633">
<p data-start=3D"2577" data-end=3D"2633"><strong data-start=3D"2577" data-e=
nd=3D"2596">Weather Effects</strong> (rain, fog affect microwaves, IR).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2636" data-end=3D"2689">
<p data-start=3D"2639" data-end=3D"2689"><strong data-start=3D"2639" data-e=
nd=3D"2668">Line-of-sight requirement</strong> (microwaves &amp; IR).</p>
</li>
