</li>
<li data-start=3D"2691" data-end=3D"3034">
<p data-start=3D"2693" data-end=3D"2728"><strong data-start=3D"2693" data-e=
nd=3D"2726">Why radio waves for cellular?</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"2731" data-end=3D"3034">
<li data-start=3D"2731" data-end=3D"2811">
<p data-start=3D"2733" data-end=3D"2811">Radio waves are <strong data-start=
=3D"2749" data-end=3D"2768">omnidirectional</strong> =E2=86=92 one base sta=
tion can cover many users.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2814" data-end=3D"2884">
<p data-start=3D"2816" data-end=3D"2884">Radio waves can <strong data-start=
=3D"2832" data-end=3D"2855">penetrate buildings</strong> =E2=86=92 better c=
overage indoors.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2887" data-end=3D"2956">
<p data-start=3D"2889" data-end=3D"2956">Microwaves need <strong data-start=
=3D"2905" data-end=3D"2922">line-of-sight</strong> =E2=86=92 impractical fo=
r mobile users.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2959" data-end=3D"3034">
<p data-start=3D"2961" data-end=3D"3034">Radio waves are <strong data-start=
=3D"2977" data-end=3D"2988">cheaper</strong> to implement than microwave in=
frastructure.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
